OL,3,GNEWSACity expects share of #432m to
OL,4,Atackle homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough is to get a share of a new
OL,7,Fgovernment pot to help it tackle
OL,8,Fhomelessness and rough sleeping.
OL,10,FLast month, the city was granted more
OL,11,Fthan #500,000 to address the issues,
OL,12,Fand the government recently announced
OL,13,Fit would invest a further #432m
OL,14,Fnationwide as part of its plan to offer
OL,15,F"everyone sleeping rough... a route off
OL,16,Fthe street or wider support before
OL,17,FChristmas".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
