OL,3,GNEWSACity expects share of #432m to
OL,4,Atackle homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough City Council said it was
OL,7,Funable to keep pace with demand for
OL,8,Fhousing support and published a
OL,9,Fstrategy aimed at halving long-term
OL,10,Frough sleeping by 2029.
OL,12,FIts homelessness and rough sleeping
OL,13,Fstrategy was due to be debated at a
OL,14,Fcabinet meeting on Tuesday.
